# SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-3.0-only
# angled.sm -- A hole along z under a flange folded back over the plate
# Copyright (c) 2026 Jakob Kastelic

# The flange, folded 140 degrees before the hole, leans back over the
# plate; the hole through the plate alone stays clear of it, though the
# box of the flange reaches into the depth of the hole.
sheet 1.5 1 0.44
plate p 0 0 60 40 origin 0 0 0 axes +x +y
flange f p +x 140 20
hole 4 50 20 along z at 0.5 depth 4
